# Privacy & Data Redaction Governance

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` data platform workspace.

## 1. PII / PHI Redaction
Personally Identifiable Information (PII) and Protected Health Information (PHI) must be anonymized, hashed, or redacted before entering intermediate or analytical storage layers.

## 2. Access Auditing
All analytical queries and data exports must produce structured audit logs capturing the querying actor, target dataset, and timestamp.
